exists su name summary verify request template ob text quoted.text.Check whether SUMMARY is semantically faithful to SOURCE.

Pass when:
- every concrete claim in SUMMARY is supported by SOURCE
- wording may be compressed but meaning remains faithful

Fail when:
- SUMMARY adds unsupported concrete facts
- SUMMARY materially overstates, distorts, or contradicts SOURCE

Output:
- PASS or FAIL only

